cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the dissertation and this archived release."
title: "Predictive Tropical Cyclogenesis Using Machine Learning: A Novel Approach to Early Warning Systems"
abstract: >-
  Source code for a spatio-temporal ConvLSTM that predicts calibrated
  genesis-location probability fields for tropical cyclogenesis across
  0-48 h lead times in two ocean basins (North Atlantic/Caribbean/Gulf and
  Western Pacific), delivered through an operational early-warning demonstrator.
